# Optional restic exclude patterns for the built-in backup.
#
# Copy this file to config/backup-excludes.txt and set:
#   COMFYUI_BACKUP_EXCLUDE_FILE=./config/backup-excludes.txt
#
# Patterns use restic's exclude syntax, including ** wildcards. Blank lines and
# comments are ignored by restic.
#
# Examples:
# **/cache/**
# **/temp/**
# **/__pycache__/**
# **/*.pyc
#
# Example model policy: include the models category, but skip a replaceable tree:
# /source/models/checkpoints/replaceable/**
#
# Example inverse-style policy using negation is also supported by restic, but
# remember that once a directory itself is excluded, files beneath it cannot be
# re-included. Prefer excluding specific replaceable subtrees instead.
